            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CDoleshal"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used real maple syrup and left out the brown sugar so it wouldn't be so sweet, as the above reviews stated. I also used 1/2 teaspoon of pumpkin pie spice in place of the other spices and gave it a spin in the food processor. Very light on flavor, which was what I was looking for, I will definately be keeping this recipe to \"play\" with.",
            "datePublished": "2015-10-24T12:41:53.510Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
